are more and more
Israelization themselves.

00:59:10.966 --> 00:59:14.553
They are, they've got a
lot of families in Israel

00:59:15.570 --> 00:59:18.760
when someone is interviewing in Israel,

00:59:18.760 --> 00:59:21.030
when there is something
happening in Israel,

00:59:21.030 --> 00:59:24.023
the French journalist will
go there and ask someone,

00:59:25.200 --> 00:59:29.113
what's happening and the guy
is going to answer in French.

00:59:30.590 --> 00:59:33.290
You will find thousands of French Jews

00:59:33.290 --> 00:59:36.940
speaking French in Israel.

00:59:36.940 --> 00:59:41.280
So the French journalist
will ask them in French,

00:59:41.280 --> 00:59:44.422
what's happening and the
guy will answer in French.

00:59:44.422 --> 00:59:46.480
So there is a kind of confusion

00:59:46.480 --> 00:59:51.070
between Israel and the French Jews.

00:59:51.070 --> 00:59:54.590
There are more and more
involved within the French.

00:59:54.590 --> 00:59:59.590
Within the Israeli history,
they eat Israeli food,

00:59:59.750 --> 01:00:04.750
they sing Israeli songs, they
read French Israeli newspaper

01:00:07.480 --> 01:00:10.720
or English Israeli newspaper.

01:00:10.720 --> 01:00:14.883
They follow day by day,
what's happening there.

01:00:15.880 --> 01:00:19.300
They dance with the
music coming from Israel,

01:00:19.300 --> 01:00:22.140
which is not the case
in the United States.

01:00:22.140 --> 01:00:25.910
As you know, American
Jews are to the contrary

01:00:26.750 --> 01:00:31.750
going far more and more far
from the Israeli situation.

01:00:32.980 --> 01:00:35.700
Most of them never went to Israel.

01:00:35.700 --> 01:00:40.570
In France, most Jews went
several times in Israel.

01:00:40.570 --> 01:00:45.570
There is the strong difference
between the two countries.

01:00:47.660 --> 01:00:51.440
- Yeah, okay, well, that I
think brings us to the end.

01:00:51.440 --> 01:00:54.450
I feel like we could
keep talking all night.

01:00:54.450 --> 01:00:58.700
But that brings us to the
end of our session today.

01:00:58.700 --> 01:01:01.130
