01:01:01.130 --> 01:01:03.800
what about the English
translation of this book?

01:01:03.800 --> 01:01:06.100
Will it be translated into English?

01:01:06.100 --> 01:01:10.697
- Maurice it's up to you,
to someone in the audience.

01:01:10.697 --> 01:01:13.240
That will be really nice.

01:01:13.240 --> 01:01:16.620
And I would be very sorry
if it's not translated.

01:01:16.620 --> 01:01:20.780
- Yeah, so what guys, it's
such a fascinating book.

01:01:20.780 --> 01:01:22.640
You're kind of updating Talk Ville

01:01:23.946 --> 01:01:26.670
and making it, the, you know, as you say,

01:01:26.670 --> 01:01:29.130
Talk Ville did, was not interested in Jews

01:01:29.130 --> 01:01:30.840
and you're kind of adding that dimension.

01:01:30.840 --> 01:01:31.930
So thank you.

01:01:31.930 --> 01:01:34.770
- You Talk Ville and you
should take care of that.

01:01:34.770 --> 01:01:37.330
- Okay, I'll translate
it in, on my spare time.

01:01:37.330 --> 01:01:40.820
Okay, well, so thank you Pierre so much,

